  "fullContentHtml": "\n<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1 ast-no-date-box\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n\n<p><!-- .entry-header --></p>\n<div class=\"entry-content clear\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<div class=\"post-desc\">\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Short Information :</strong> <a style=\"color: #ff0000;\" href=\"https://bankofindia.co.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Bank of India (BOI)</a></span> has released a Notification for the post of Specialist Officer (SO). This recruitment was released for 205 posts. Applications for the Bank of India Specialist Officer SO Recruitment 2026 will Start from 10 September 2026, &amp; Candidate can apply till 25 September 2026. Candidates must check the complete details for Bank of India Specialist Officer SO Recruitment 2026 which has given below.</span></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable1\">\n<table style=\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; width: 100%;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Bank of India (BOI)</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\">Bank of India Specialist Officer SO Recruitment 2026</span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Notification Date : <strong>31 August 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Application Start Date : <strong>10 September 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date : <span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>25 September 2026</strong></span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Fee Payment Last Date : <strong>25 September 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Exam Date : <strong>Notify Soon</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Admit Card : <strong>Notify Soon</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Application Fee</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">General, EWS, OBC <strong>: Rs. 1180/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">SC, ST, PWD <strong>: Rs. 175/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates have to pay their Examination Fee Through Debit Card / Credit Card / Net Banking / UPI and Other Fee Payment Mode Only.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">[adinserter block=”3″]</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Bank of India Specialist Officer Notification 2026 : Age Limit</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Age Limit As On 01 August 2026</span></strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Check Post Wise Age Limit :</span> <a href=\"https://bankofindia.bank.in/documents/20121/28761619/FINAL_ANNEXURE_I.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Age Relaxation as per Bank of India SO Recruitment Rules.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Use <span style=\"color: #000000; background-color: #ffff00;\"> </span>Tool – </span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Bank of India SO 2026 : Vacancy Details</strong></span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Total Posts : 205 Posts</strong></span></p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 34.2135%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 15.4237%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>General&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 13.0947%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>EWS</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 12.5089%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>OBC</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 12.4365%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>SC</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 12.3229%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>ST</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 34.2135%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Specialist Officer</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 15.4237%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">92</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 13.0947%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">18</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 12.5089%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">53</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 12.4365%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">29</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 12.3229%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">13</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Bank of India Specialist Officer Recruitment 2025 : Educational Qualification</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates have Bachelor / Engineering / Law Degree from any recognized university in India &amp; must have knowledge of Local Language.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Check Post Wise Qualification Details :&nbsp;<a href=\"https://bankofindia.bank.in/documents/20121/28761619/FINAL_ANNEXURE_I.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Click Here</a></strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">All candidates must read the official information completely before applying.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Bank of India Specialist Officer Online Form 2026 : </strong></span><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Mode of Selection</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Written Examination</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Document Verification</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Language Proficiency Test</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Medical Examination</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>How To Apply Bank of India SO Online Form 2026</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates can apply through link https://bankofindia.co.in/ or provided below in link section or they can also apply through official site of the BOI before Last Date.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">You Can Check other&nbsp;&nbsp;Notification Here –&nbsp;</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">For all the interested and eligible candidates who want to apply for Bank of India SO recruitment can read all t